  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie: Forskning och privatsektor</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study: Research and the private sector - Study: Research and</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Studien kommer att analysera och identifiera potentiella samarbetsomr&#xe5;den mellan det svenska st&#xf6;det till forskningssamarbete och det svenska st&#xf6;det till privatsektorutveckling i Uganda. Baserat p&#xe5; ovan analys kommer den g&#xf6;ra rekommendationer vad g&#xe4;ller identifierade samarbetsomr&#xe5;den och f&#xf6;resl&#xe5; strategiska insatser inom dessa omr&#xe5;den. D&#xe4;rmed kommer studien utg&#xf6;ra ett viktigt st&#xf6;d i genomf&#xf6;randet av resultatstrategin f&#xf6;r Sveriges internationella bist&#xe5;nd till Uganda 2014-2018.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The study will analyze and identify potential areas of cooperation between the Swedish support for research cooperation and the Swedish support to private sector development in Uganda. Based on the above analysis, it will make recommendations on identified areas of cooperation, and propose strategic interventions in these areas. Thus, the study will provide inform the operationalization of the &quot;Resultstrategy for Sweden&apos;s international aid to Uganda 2014-2018&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
